WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
You are a poor student

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,080
Even the chicken armor is Qilinfa’s initial chicken armor.

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,360
No modifications at all

4
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,120
The biscuit cooler for the preliminary round was borrowed from your brothers.

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:09,080
Just tell me why we have to take you with us. Even though we won this game, I didn’t take off my clothes and retreat.

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,520
You can only win this one, understand?

7
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,960
What will you win in the next game?

8
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,480
They will shoot you with live ammunition

9
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,720
You use bare metal to carry it?

10
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,480
With the bonus I can also modify it

11
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,440
Will you? Do you understand? Before this

12
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,880
What should I do if the chicken armor is broken?

13
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:20,840
If you get hurt again

14
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,080
The brothers still have to explain to Qilin.

15
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,520
Then this is my own choice

16
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,480
Come on, stop talking.

17
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,880
We just don't want to team up with you

18
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,120
You should look for whoever you want later.

19
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,050
If you guessed correctly

20
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,370
That's what they do

21
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,610
Recruit good newcomers

22
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:33,730
Play a game to earn qualifications

23
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,250
Then sell the qualification to others

24
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,170
Who can guarantee the future

25
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,330
Always win every game

26
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,530
How tiring it is to play the game

27
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:39,570
Where can I buy it easily?

28
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:40,490
Are some of you right?
